<import src="../../major-discussion/common.wxml" />
<view class="screen"><view class="title">专业讨论独立恢复</view><template is="discussion-status" data="{{status,error,receiptStatus,deletionLocatorUnavailable,hasSession,busy,frozen,recoveryMajorId,recoveryOperation,recoveryCommentId,recoveryPhase,confirming}}" />
<view class="card"><view class="section-title">撤回自己的已发布讨论</view><view class="notice">仅显示本机近期已确认发布的编号，不是完整历史；不保存正文。点击后独立核验当前撤回权限。</view><button wx:for="{{deletionLocators}}" wx:key="commentId" data-id="{{item.commentId}}" bindtap="onOwnDelete" disabled="{{busy || frozen || confirming}}">核验撤回权限：{{item.commentId}}</button></view>
<template is="discussion-form" data="{{loaded,frozen,mode,busy,confirming,replyTarget,body,bodyBytes,canPublish,selectedComment,deleteTarget,imageEnabled,imageCount,imageBusy,imageFrozen}}" />
<view class="card"><view class="section-title">自己的点赞查询与撤回</view><view class="notice">不需要公开专业仍可查看。下列近期编号只用于定位，不代表仍然点赞，也不是完整历史。</view>
<button wx:for="{{ownReferences}}" wx:key="commentId" data-id="{{item.commentId}}" bindtap="onOwnReference" disabled="{{busy || frozen || confirming}}">查询近期评论 {{item.commentId}}</button>
<input value="{{ownMajorDraft}}" bindinput="onOwnMajor" disabled="{{busy || frozen || confirming}}" placeholder="专业编号" /><input value="{{ownCommentDraft}}" bindinput="onOwnComment" disabled="{{busy || frozen || confirming}}" placeholder="评论编号" />
<button bindtap="onLookupOwn" disabled="{{busy || frozen || confirming}}">查询自己的当前点赞</button>
<view wx:if="{{own &amp;&amp; own.kind === 'recorded'}}">当前：{{own.active ? '已点赞' : '未点赞'}} · {{own.recordedAt}}</view><view wx:elif="{{own &amp;&amp; own.kind === 'not_liked'}}">已确认没有点赞记录</view><view wx:elif="{{own &amp;&amp; own.kind === 'unavailable'}}">历史暂不能确认，不能当作未点赞</view>
<button wx:if="{{canUnlike}}" bindtap="onUnlike" disabled="{{busy || frozen || confirming}}">核对后取消我的赞</button>
<view wx:if="{{confirming === 'unlike'}}" class="confirmation"><view>确认取消当前账号对评论 {{ownCommentDraft}} 的赞？</view><button bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{busy}}">确认取消我的赞</button><button bindtap="onCloseConfirmation" disabled="{{busy}}">返回</button></view></view>
<navigator class="link" url="/pages/major-discussion-notices/major-discussion-notices">专业讨论通知 →</navigator></view>

<template is="discussion-image-state" data="{{imageEnabled,imageStatus,imagePending,imageBusy,imageProgress,imageRequestId,imageRecoverable,imageCancelConfirm,busy}}" />
<template is="discussion-gallery" data="{{galleryOpen,gallerySrc,galleryStatus,galleryIndex,galleryCount}}" />
